  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "000000000001",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000000",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Guía del tiempo en Egipto"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000003",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000002",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Comprender el clima de Egipto"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000009",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000005",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "000000000004"
          ],
          "text": "El clima de Egipto"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000006",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " es predominantemente árido, con veranos calurosos, inviernos suaves y muy pocas precipitaciones a lo largo del año."
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000007",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000008",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Sin embargo, el tiempo puede variar significativamente entre las regiones costeras, el delta del Nilo y las zonas desérticas."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000004",
          "_type": "externalLink",
          "href": "https://www.egiptoexclusivo.com/informacion-practica/clima/",
          "newTab": true
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000000b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000000a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Zonas Costeras (Costa Mediterránea)"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000000d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000000c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Verano (de junio a agosto)"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000011",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000000e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Cálido, con temperaturas que oscilan entre los 22°C (72°F) y los 30°C (86°F)."
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000010",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "La brisa marina hace que las zonas costeras sean más confortables que el interior."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000013",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000012",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Invierno (de diciembre a febrero)"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000017",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000014",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Suave y lluviosa, con temperaturas que oscilan entre los 10°C (50°F) y los 18°C (64°F)."
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000015",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "gpkjbdzpwcrq",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Es la estación más lluviosa en lugares como "
        },
        {
          "_key": "7v6lb6ekwf98",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "kw7vgn9nujdm"
          ],
          "text": "Alejandría"
        },
        {
          "_key": "y0z126asdw4x",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", pero sigue siendo relativamente seca en comparación con otras partes del mundo."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "kw7vgn9nujdm",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58750",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000019",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "8lhlzuodbapu",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "vikcivffpyn7"
          ],
          "text": "El Cairo"
        },
        {
          "_key": "s258rspwrvlb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " y el Delta del Nilo"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "vikcivffpyn7",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-83284",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000001b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000001a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Verano"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000001f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000001c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Caluroso y seco, con temperaturas que a menudo superan los 35°C durante el día."
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Las noches son más frescas, lo que proporciona cierto alivio."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000021",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000020",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Invierno"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000025",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000022",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Suave y algo más fresco, con temperaturas diurnas de unos 18°C (64°F) a 22°C (72°F)."
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000023",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000024",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Las noches pueden ser frescas y requerir una chaqueta ligera."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000027",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "z30c5hbjvf51",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Sur de Egipto y Valle del Nilo ("
        },
        {
          "_key": "e29dhnblsmcy",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "buezybcg2mco"
          ],
          "text": "Luxor"
        },
        {
          "_key": "i2c0zssg4y0g",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "_key": "vppocrhoxo4j",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "0c4povknzfid"
          ],
          "text": "Asuán"
        },
        {
          "_key": "bu2w934by53r",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ")"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "buezybcg2mco",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58877",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        },
        {
          "_key": "0c4povknzfid",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58758",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000029",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000028",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Verano"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000002d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000002a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Extremadamente caluroso, con temperaturas diurnas que alcanzan los 40°C (104°F) o más."
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000002b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000002c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Es esencial mantenerse hidratado y evitar las actividades al aire libre durante las horas de más sol."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000002f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000002e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Invierno"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000031",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000030",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Cálida y agradable, con temperaturas que oscilan entre los 14°C (57°F) y los 26°C (79°F), por lo que es la época ideal para visitar lugares antiguos."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000033",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000032",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Zonas Desérticas (Desierto Occidental, Península del Sinaí)"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000036",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000034",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Durante el día:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000035",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Puede ser extremadamente caluroso en verano, con temperaturas que superan los 40°C (104°F)."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000039",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000037",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Por la noche:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000038",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Las temperaturas descienden considerablemente, sobre todo en invierno, que puede ser sorprendentemente frío, a veces rozando el punto de congelación."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000003b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000003a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Mejor época para visitar"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000041",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000003c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "La mejor época para visitar Egipto es durante los meses más fríos, de octubre a abril."
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000003d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000003e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "El tiempo es agradable en todo el país, por lo que es ideal para explorar monumentos antiguos y disfrutar de los balnearios del Mar Rojo."
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000003f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000040",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "De diciembre a febrero es la temporada turística alta, sobre todo en Luxor y Asuán, donde el tiempo es cálido y soleado, perfecto para los cruceros por el Nilo."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000043",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000042",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Consejos para viajar según el tiempo"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000048",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000044",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Visitas de verano:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000045",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Empieza el día temprano para combatir el calor."
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000046",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000047",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Lleva ropa ligera y transpirable, sombrero de ala ancha, gafas de sol y aplícate crema solar con regularidad."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000004f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000049",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Visitas de invierno:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000004a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Lleva ropa variada."
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000004b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000004c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Los días son cálidos, pero las noches pueden ser frescas, sobre todo en el desierto."
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000004d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000004e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Será necesario llevar una chaqueta ligera o un jersey."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000052",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000050",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Mantente hidratado:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000051",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Independientemente de la estación, mantente hidratado bebiendo mucha agua, sobre todo cuando visites lugares al aire libre."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000054",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000053",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Conclusión"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000005d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000055",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "El clima de Egipto influye significativamente en la experiencia del viaje, desde decidir cuándo visitarlo hasta elegir qué meter en la maleta."
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000056",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000057",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Si conoces los patrones climáticos y te preparas en consecuencia, puedes asegurarte un viaje cómodo y agradable a esta encantadora tierra de maravillas antiguas y belleza natural."
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000058",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000059",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Ya sea tomando el sol junto al Mediterráneo, explorando las majestuosas "
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000005b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "00000000005a"
          ],
          "text": "pirámides de Giza"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000005c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " o navegando por el Nilo, el clima de Egipto es un compañero clave en tu viaje a través del tiempo y la cultura."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000005a",
          "_type": "externalLink",
          "href": "/es/guide/guiza/la-meseta-de-guiza",
          "newTab": true
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    }
  ],
